                        Bureau</hi>, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 201.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d42-f2" n="99" xml:id="d42-f2-content">
                <p>Giuseppe Motta, Swiss delegate to the General Disarmament Conference.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
